{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The Masons are our eyes and ear in the Old World. Though we choose not to associate with the Gods of the Old World, It is only a safe guard against the brutality of some, and not a disdain for all.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:17:02.719000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746100506887323728","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Long have we trusted their wisdom in regards to the dealings of the divine and infernal.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:17:37.776000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746100653926907934","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods, listening intently.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:17:59.124000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746100743466909787","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Those of new roanoke have lived closely with this new faction. Do the Masons of Roanoke trust the efficacy of their methods?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:18:33.285000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746100886748528641","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Many of us have become friends, family to each other. Trust their plan to work if not interrupted. Knights here are good people.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:19:48.063000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101200390324405","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Dregen, Your colony has a sin to set right.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:21:09.160000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101540535926855","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Feck.\" The Dwarf grumbles.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:21:24.965000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101606826770472","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web chuckles sadly.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:21:37.764000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101660509667468","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Upon your arrival, Queen Kimvor broke our barrier.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:21:49.564000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101710002323527","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"The defense that protected us has long been absent.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:22:38.849000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746101916718858290","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Fontaine's barrier of fish has allowed this group to arrive. Others may come too.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:23:08.237000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746102039981064262","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"It isn't enough.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:23:23.162000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746102102581051392","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"He looks at the swirling golden orb he had been beating on as web arrived.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:23:53.947000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746102231702569012","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"( O R B )","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:24:10.540000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746102301298655319","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Use essences to repair the barrier?\" Web asks hesitantly","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:24:30.434000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746102384740270235","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Changing intention is hard. But, if it corrects what me an the other colonists of Ole Roanoke did when we brought that evil witch to your shores. Its not impossible.\" He seems to be thinking it over.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:26:51.848000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T20:27:49.471000Z","id":"746102977873576046","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They think for a moment. \"Know knights plan to restore the 15 once hunger defeated. Also know that their presence will draw evil gods to new world. What if allow gods to be restored, then repair barrier right after? Could make so that non-evil gods have much power in new world? Prevent downside to restoring gods?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:28:28.957000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746103385178112122","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"It would also mean tha you could keep the tools til the end of the battle.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:29:17.865000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T20:29:29.912000Z","id":"746103590313001040","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Theres a practicality to yer thinkin.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:29:53.651000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746103740410626180","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Thank you. Trying best to do most good.\" They smile. \"Would restoring gods just before new barrier work?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:30:53.939000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746103993276563586","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They look to Oro.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:31:20.858000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746104106183163954","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Could do. Just don't keep swingin till its ugly mug is paste, Then release the magic of the tools. Once you shine the light of this dream stone on them they will be ready to release the tinkers and masons of old to follow yer intentions.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:33:01.586000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746104528666886305","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"He takes one last swing, and then hands the orb to Web.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:33:44.825000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746104710024659024","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods and takes the orb reverently. \"This a true dream stone then.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:34:55.089000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746105004732973146","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Last of its kind. It was instrumental in the defeat of the Sibriex last time.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:36:21.852000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746105368643502161","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They look at it in awe. \"Circle legend speaks of these. Have lesser versions, more trinkets than anything. But this... This powerful. Can feel it.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:37:28.219000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746105647007006863","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Its all thats left of our legacy. Take care with it, some of them were my family.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:38:16.679000Z","edited_at":"2020-08-20T20:38:33.051000Z","id":"746105850262847658","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Of course.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:41:30.314000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746106662427033650","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They look once more to Oro. \"Will restoring barrier after good gods restored work like Web want it to?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:42:36.058000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746106938177224824","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They gently stow the orb into their bag.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:42:45.828000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746106979155574819","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"Aye, it'll work. But remember, no matter who might perish in the final battle, no matter what hardships come. This task has to be set with the clearest and firmest intentions. There isn't another way to use the dream stone once your intentions are set, and anything less than that won't work. If their is mourning to be done, do it after the task is completed.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:46:51.656000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746108010232938548","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Web nods. \"Good. Can do that. And think other colonists will approve too.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:49:11.581000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746108597121056800","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
