{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"Dregen puts on pants.","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:50:42.730000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746108979427409932","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They bow in thanks to Oro and Dregen. \"Thank you. Will also see cornerstone set soon.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:51:14.031000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746109110713450516","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"DM radar","id":"313689699627696139","is_bot":0,"username":"bfdm"},"author_id":"313689699627696139","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"\"With that done its time to go visit my daughter. Its time to leave the Ossuary.\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:51:58.946000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746109299100483757","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Eloise >:3c","id":"260820438026813440","is_bot":0,"username":"effervescenteloise"},"author_id":"260820438026813440","channel_id":"733827764133822465","content":"They nod. \"Could tell me about Oblex while we walk?\"","created_at":"2020-08-20T20:52:35.276000Z","edited_at":null,"id":"746109451479679017","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
